=== Grand Alliance for National Unity ===

{{Nayib Bukele sidebar}}

The Grand Alliance for National Unity held its primary election on 29 July 2018. Two candidates participated in the election, [[Nayib Bukele]], the former mayor of San Salvador from 2015 to 2018, and {{ill|Will Salgado|es|Will Salgado}}, the former mayor of [[San Miguel, El Salvador|San Miguel]], but the day before the election, Salgado announced that he withdrew from the primary. Although Salgado withdrew, his name was still on the ballot,<ref name="GANAel">{{cite web|url=http://elmundo.sv/gana-inicia-sus-elecciones-internas/|title=GANA Inicia Sus Elecciones Internas|trans-title=GANA Initiates Its Internal Elections|language=es|date=29 July 2018|access-date=2 April 2023|work=[[El Mundo (El Salvador)|El Mundo]]|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180729190250/http://elmundo.sv/gana-inicia-sus-elecciones-internas/|archive-date=29 July 2018|url-status=dead}}</ref> but regardless, Bukele won 93.71 percent of the vote and was selected as the party's presidential nominee.<ref name="Bukelenom">{{cite web|url=http://elmundo.sv/nayib-bukele-se-convierte-en-candidato-presidencial-de-gana/|title=Nayib Bukele se Convierte en Candidato Presidencial de GANA|trans-title=Nayib Bukele Becomes the Presidential Candidate for GANA|language=es|date=29 July 2018|work=[[El Mundo (El Salvador)|El Mundo]]|access-date=3 April 2023|archive-date=5 February 2019|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190205044002/https://elmundo.sv/nayib-bukele-se-convierte-en-candidato-presidencial-de-gana/|url-status=dead}}</ref><ref name="GANAel" /> Bukele's campaign slogan was "Let's Make History" ("{{lang|es|Hagamos Historia}}").<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.panoramical.eu/america-latina-y-caribe/hagamos-historia-nayib-bukele-elegido-presidente-de-el-salvador/|title="Hagamos Historia". Nayib Bukele, Elegido Presidente de El Salvador|trans-title="Let's Make History". Nayib Bukele, Elected President of El Salvador|language=es|date=4 February 2019|access-date=24 May 2023|work=Panoramical.eu}}</ref>

